00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:05.940
I say cake loosely.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:07.140
Let's get to decorating.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:10.410
Place one cake layer,
flat side up on platter.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:12.540
So we're gonna turn one
of the cake layers over,

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:14.520
which is what we usually
do for the top layer.

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:16.320
But I guess this time, Charlie wants us

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:17.700
to do it for the bottom layer.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:18.533
What's next?

00:09:18.533 --> 00:09:20.100
Spread with one cup frosting.

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:21.510
Okay. I'm gonna eyeball this.

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:23.250
The frosting is spreading very well.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:24.330
You can see the chili flakes.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:25.890
It's a little alarming, but it's fine.

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:29.040
Top with second cake layer flat side down.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:31.890
Spread remaining frosting
over top and sides of cake.

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:32.723
We can do that.

00:09:32.723 --> 00:09:33.810
There's lots of frosting left.

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:35.430
After taking out these cakes,

00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:37.230
I feel like Charlie's mad at me.

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:39.060
I'm liking the texture of the frosting

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:41.250
more than I'm liking
the texture of the cake.

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:42.480
That's based on looks.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:43.890
We'll find out about the taste.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:47.220
I don't think people are gonna
use AI recipes in the future

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:50.130
because I think the food community

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:53.730
is very keen on developing
recipes from the heart.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:56.610
I just feel like this cake recipe was made

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:58.680
from a place of sadness or anger.

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:01.650
Well, this remaining
frosting has been on the top

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:02.910
and the sides of the cake.

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:05.913
She looks pretty good, Charlie.

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:08.760
- So now I've gotten the
ganache all over the cake,

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:10.980
got some like old fashioned
swoops and swirls here,

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:12.750
and I really think our taste
testers are gonna like it.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.300
- I'm not sure if our taste
tester, Jeri, will like this,

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.100
but let's bring her in
and see what she thinks.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:17.933
- Hi everyone.

00:10:17.933 --> 00:10:20.160
I'm Jeri and I love chocolate cake.

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.000
Moment of truth.

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:22.680
Let's bring 'em in.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:25.440
I think I'll start with this one first.

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:29.460
And at first glance, the
texture looks kind of moist

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:31.083
but I like the frosting on it.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.940
Not too sweet, which is
exactly how I like my cake.

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:38.730
Velvety. That frosting is
thick, but very, very good.

00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:39.563
I like that a lot.

00:10:39.563 --> 00:10:43.837
Slice number two, it looks
very dense, very decadent.

00:10:43.837 --> 00:10:47.100
(suspenseful adventure music)

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:48.000
That frosting's good.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.050
It's a little bit more rich.

00:10:49.050 --> 00:10:52.290
I think this one's a lot
more moist and less sweet.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:53.640
This one tastes a little bit off.

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:54.473
Just the frosting.

00:10:54.473 --> 00:10:56.370
I think when I had the cake,
it was a little bit dry,

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:57.720
but then when I tried the frosting,

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.670
it seemed a little, it just, I don't,

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:00.840
I can't put my finger on it.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:02.310
It just tastes kind of off.

00:11:02.310 --> 00:11:04.530
Is this the chili flake in
it, like legit right there?

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:05.790
Perhaps. Is it?

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:07.362
Is there like a hot pepper in this thing?

00:11:07.362 --> 00:11:09.720
- [Producer] They're red
pepper flakes in the frosting.

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:10.560
- Really?

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.420
That makes sense, 'cause I did like taste

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:13.950
a hint of spiciness.

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:14.783
You guys got me.

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:18.000
Are y'all ready to know which one I chose?

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:18.870
- Yes.
- Yes.

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:20.986
- I had to go with this one.

00:11:20.986 --> 00:11:22.230
(bell rings)

00:11:22.230 --> 00:11:23.790
- Charlie!
- I'm sorry.

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:26.130
- I am curious, though,
and I would love to try it.

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:26.963
Cheers.
- Cheers.

00:11:26.963 --> 00:11:28.080
- It's not bad.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.160
- It's a little dry, but.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:30.360
- Oh, kinda spicy.

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:32.760
- Mine's very like subtle, and the frost,

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:34.140
well, now it's not getting worse.

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:35.228
- Yeah.
- Wanna try yours?

00:11:35.228 --> 00:11:36.061
- Yes, let's do that.

00:11:36.061 --> 00:11:36.894
I mean, I already know
what it tastes like,

00:11:36.894 --> 00:11:37.830
so now I gotta hear what you think.

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:39.030
- Mm.

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:40.750
Much more moist.

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:43.140
- And no chili heat.
- For improvement?

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:45.000
- [Producer] Does Charlie
have a future on Tasty?

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:47.670
- Charlie interns, but that was it.

00:11:47.670 --> 00:11:48.810
All right, guys, that was so much fun.

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:49.890
Thanks so much for watching.

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:51.660
If you wanna see any
other foods, leave them

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:54.210
in the comments, and Charlie
will get to them next time.

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:55.440
Bye!

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:57.269
- [Man] Oh, ho, yes.

00:11:57.269 --> 00:12:00.352
